{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the story of a character torn from their own world and dragged into an unknown realm.<br><i>A.S.\u0130: BEGINNING</i> is a single-player action RPG that draws players in with its dark atmosphere and intense action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in this world, you must fight, follow the guidance of a mysterious voice, and decide your own fate. On the thin line between the real world and the game world, every choice will either take you back home or trap you here forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat</strong> \u2013 Fluid and tactical combat mechanics inspired by soulslike games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Powers</strong> \u2013 Dominate the battlefield with deadly spells, special abilities, and devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong> \u2013 An immersive narrative shifting between the real world and the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Gothic structures, deadly enemies, and dangerous regions full of secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Experience</strong> \u2013 A pure, uninterrupted, story-driven adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play It?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A.S.\u0130: BEGINNING</i> blends soulslike elements with a modern action-RPG structure. With a story that challenges the boundaries between reality and the digital world, it offers not just a game, but an unforgettable immersive experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966940?t=1760377379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966940/1efb74156366f2d20a5e5ca41728d28287ced1ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760377379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966940/4ebe4bcd85737694915ac593d37ccb155373e2a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760377379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966940/4ebe4bcd85737694915ac593d37ccb155373e2a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760377379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of fantasy violence, blood effects, and intense combat in dark, atmospheric environments. Players will fight with melee weapons against various enemies. No sexual assault, non-consensual content, or self-harm themes are present."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3984070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the story of a character torn from their own world and dragged into an unknown realm.<br><i>A.S.\u0130: BEGINNING</i> is a single-player action RPG that draws players in with its dark atmosphere and intense action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in this world, you must fight, follow the guidance of a mysterious voice, and decide your own fate. On the thin line between the real world and the game world, every choice will either take you back home or trap you here forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat</strong> \u2013 Fluid and tactical combat mechanics inspired by soulslike games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Powers</strong> \u2013 Dominate the battlefield with deadly spells, special abilities, and devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><